---
import ServicePage from '../components/ServicePage.astro';
---
<ServicePage slug="integrated-security-systems" description="Access control and CCTV from Apex Cyber Security in Sevenoaks, Kent: card, fob, mobile and keypad door entry, and enterprise camera systems with cloud video management.">
  <section class="section sub" id="access" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="main">
        <h2><span class="fn" data-fn="PR">PR.AA</span> Access control</h2>
        <p class="lede">Control who goes where, and keep a record of it. We supply and install electric strikes and readers that work with cards, fobs, mobile phones or PIN keypads.</p>
        <p>Electric strikes fit most existing doors, frames and locks, so access control can go into a refurbishment as easily as a new building. They are hard-wearing, need little maintenance, and can be managed centrally as your people and premises change.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <h3 class="side-h">Suited to</h3>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Offices and commercial buildings</li><li>Warehouses and industrial units</li><li>Schools and public buildings</li><li>Event and conference venues</li><li>Care homes and residential blocks</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sub" id="cameras" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="main">
        <h2><span class="fn" data-fn="DE">DE.CM</span> Enterprise CCTV</h2>
        <p class="lede">Camera systems designed around your site, with video managed in the cloud and linked to your access control.</p>
        <p>We survey the site, design the layout and install wired or wireless cameras, recorders and controllers, then connect them securely to your network. Recording capacity and retention are sized to what you need to keep.</p>
        <p>Our engineers stay involved after installation, so the system keeps protecting your people and assets as your site changes.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="side">
        <h3 class="side-h">Options include</h3>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Dome, bullet and pan-tilt-zoom cameras</li><li>Weatherproof external units</li><li>Motorised zoom</li><li>Audio capture</li><li>High-definition and 4K recording</li><li>Cloud video management</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</ServicePage>

<style>
  .sub h2 { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: .4rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-top: var(--s4); border-top: 2px solid var(--ink); }
  .sub h2 .fn { font-size: .85rem; }
  .side-h { font-family: var(--f-text); font-size: var(--t-small); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0; color: var(--ink-2); padding-top: var(--s4); margin-bottom: .5rem; }
  .ticks { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .ticks li { padding: .55rem 0 .55rem 1.4rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); position: relative; }
  .ticks li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .ticks li::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; top: 1.1rem; width: .55rem; height: .55rem; background: var(--ink); }
</style>
